## 3. Defect D3 (full record: /logs/defects/D3.md)
First resolution chose scikit-learn 1.9.0 -> `import smac` ImportError (smac 2.4.0
imports private sklearn.tree._tree.DTYPE, removed in 1.9.0; smac metadata uncapped:
scikit-learn>=1.6.1). debug-mantra applied (repro -> fail path -> 4 hypotheses, 3
disproved -> metadata cross-check). Fix: scikit-learn<1.9 cap in requirements.in
(carried caveat) -> re-resolve -> scikit-learn 1.8.0. Validated: bare import + full
probe + train/predict smoke green.

